fter the patch, sized by","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s patch surface. Every pattern that lands is a deliverable, verified against","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Origami’s own render, and shipped as a DocC-embedded example.","type":"text"}],"title":"Swami","identifier":"doc:\/\/samatwork.Swami\/documentation\/Swami","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/swami"}}}